Subject: [PATCH] Fil-C port for libxcrypt

Ported from github.com/pizlonator/fil-c projects/libxcrypt-4.5.2.
Only the source hunk is kept: oe-core builds libxcrypt from the git
tree, which has no autotools-generated Makefile.in for the second hunk.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff -ruN '--exclude=.git' libxcrypt-oe/lib/alg-yescrypt-opt.c filc-proj/projects/libxcrypt-4.5.2/lib/alg-yescrypt-opt.c
--- libxcrypt-oe/lib/alg-yescrypt-opt.c	2025-11-05 11:49:40.000000000 +0200
+++ filc-proj/projects/libxcrypt-4.5.2/lib/alg-yescrypt-opt.c	2026-10-29 21:10:28.254543157 +0200
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@
 
 #include "crypt-port.h"
 
+#undef __SSE2__
+#undef __SSE__
+
 #if INCLUDE_yescrypt || INCLUDE_scrypt || INCLUDE_gost_yescrypt || \
     INCLUDE_sm3_yescrypt
 
